# 🏋️ FitLog — Workout Library

**Train With Intent. Log Every Set.**

FitLog is a modern workout library web application designed to help users explore workouts, organize their daily fitness plans, and save their favorite exercises for later.

With a clean dark interface and a simple user experience, FitLog makes workout planning easier and more organized.

## 🚀 Live Demo

[View Live Project](YOUR_LIVE_WEBSITE_URL)

## ✨ Key Features

- **Workout Library:** Explore a collection of workouts with detailed information.
- **Workout Details:** View exercise descriptions, muscle groups, equipment, difficulty levels, and instructions.
- **Today's Plan:** Add workouts to your daily workout plan and manage your routine.
- **Save for Later:** Bookmark your favorite workouts and access them anytime.
- **Mark as Done:** Mark completed workouts and keep track of your progress.

